# F2 test: ABC homing, homing state, soft limits, and position reporting.
#
# Exercises the extra-axis homing contract built on top of the F1
# declarative ABC config: bare G28 homes every homeable extra axis,
# explicit G28 <axis> homes a single extra axis, homeable axes require
# homing before movement, non-homeable axes are exempt, M211 gates soft
# limits, and M84 clears extra-axis homing state.
DICTIONARY atmega2560.dict
CONFIG extra_axis_declarative.cfg

# Bare G28 homes XYZ plus every homeable extra axis (B).
G28

# Homeable B moves after homing; non-homeable A/C move without homing.
G1 X20 Y20 Z10 A10 B5 C10 F3000
G1 A25 C30

# Explicit single-axis homing of an extra axis.
G28 B
G1 B10

# Position queries report all configured axes.
GET_POSITION
M114

# M211 S0 disables soft-limit checks: out-of-range B move is allowed.
M211 S0
G1 B100

# Re-enable limits and move back into range.
M211 S1
G1 B0

# M84 clears homing state for XYZ and the extra axes.
M84

# Re-home the extra axis and move again.
G28 B
G1 B5
